<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Advanced Micro.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Advanced Micro.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities raised its 1996 earnings per share view for Advanced Micro Devices Inc to a loss of $0.59 from a loss of $0.70, according to a source at the brokerage.</p>
<p>-- The source said Prudential raised its 1997 EPS view to a profit of $1.75 from a profit of $1.25.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 7/8 at 27-3/4.</p>
</text>
